    {
      "text": "Stir zucchini, eggs, and green onion together in a large bowl. Mix flour, Parmesan cheese, baking powder, salt, and oregano together in a separate bowl; stir into zucchini mixture until batter is just moistened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fBs8ZLfsOO8Tjk4RNbyvsuFzJRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222870-moms-zucchini-pancakes-DDMFS-Step-03-e319fe84764a4b8d81d8f109b5b84f53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222870/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Drop rounded spoonfuls of zucchini batter into hot oil; pan-fry until golden, 2 to 3 minutes per side.",
